Package: bstep
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: x11-xserver-utils
Description: visual interpreter and exercises for learning C
 bstep runs a subset of C and lets learners step through instructions,
 inspect memory and compare their predictions with the program's output.
 .
 It includes a graphical interface, an interactive terminal interface
 and ready-to-use exercise courses.
